\name{omphc-package}
\alias{omphc-package}
\docType{package}
\title{
Bayesian Network Learning Using the OMP Algorithm
}

\description{
Bayesian network learning using the orthogonal matching pursuit to perform variable selection and then application of
the Hill-Climbing greedy search or the TABU search to orient the edges. Some relevant papers are
Tsagris M. (2021), <doi:10.1007/s10614-020-10065-7>, Tsagris M. (2022) <doi:10.3390/math10152604>,
Tsagris et al. (2022) <doi:10.1109/TCBB.2020.3029952>, Tsamardinos I., Brown E.L. and Aliferis F.C. (2006) <doi:10.1007/s10994-006-6889-7>
and Mallat S. G. and Zhang Z. (1993) <doi:10.1109/78.258082>.
}

